  "heading": "LZSS Mode 7 Gallery",
  "lede": "A complete LZSS compressor and decompressor benchmark running on the 3.58 MHz\n      65816. Sixty artworks form a 930,035-byte corpus: each is decoded, displayed through Mode 7,\n      recompressed on the SNES, compared byte-for-byte with the host golden stream, decoded again,\n      checksummed, and verified.",
