  "doc": "<h2>The benchmark</h2> <p>The aspect-preserving, up-to-219-color corpus compresses from <b>930,035</b> to <b>884,107 bytes</b>,\n      a weighted <b>4.94%</b> reduction—high-color dither is a deliberately difficult LZSS input.\n      Every work is rendered at its largest tile-budget fit.\n      Left/Right navigation cancels the current stage immediately and starts the selected work\n      without contaminating its benchmark sample. The final WRAM oracle is <code>0x1D8E</code>.</p> <h2>Current candidate corpus</h2><p>All 63 current candidates are shown below using\n      the actual indexed image prepared for the SNES. Every title links to its canonical museum or\n      collection record. The cartridge is being curated back to 8 Mbit (1 MiB), so this visual list\n      is intentionally published before the next ROM.</p> <div class=\"rp-gallery\"> <article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/24645\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/great-wave-web.png\" alt=\"Under the Wave off Kanagawa by Katsushika Hokusai\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/24645\">Under the Wave off Kanagawa</a></h3> <p>Katsushika Hokusai<br><span>c. 1830-1832</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/28560\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/bedroom-web.png\" alt=\"The Bedroom by Vincent van Gogh\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/28560\">The Bedroom</a></h3> <p>Vincent van Gogh<br><span>1889</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/27992\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/grande-jatte-web.png\" alt=\"A Sunday on La Grande Jatte — 1884 by Georges Seurat\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/27992\">A Sunday on La Grande Jatte — 1884</a></h3> <p>Georges Seurat<br><span>1884-1886; border added 1888-1889</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/16568\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/water-lilies-web.png\" alt=\"Water Lilies by Claude Monet\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/16568\">Water Lilies</a></h3> <p>Claude Monet<br><span>1906</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/111436\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/basket-apples-web.png\" alt=\"The Basket of Apples by Paul Cézanne\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/111436\">The Basket of Apples</a></h3> <p>Paul Cézanne<br><span>c. 1893</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/111318\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/stack-wheat-web.png\" alt=\"Stack of Wheat by Claude Monet\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/111318\">Stack of Wheat</a></h3> <p>Claude Monet<br><span>1890-1891</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/80607\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/self-portrait-web.png\" alt=\"Self-Portrait by Vincent van Gogh\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-caption\"> <h3><a href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/80607\">Self-Portrait</a></h3> <p>Vincent van Gogh<br><span>1887</span></p> </div> </article><article class=\"rp-work\"> <a class=\"rp-work-image\" href=\"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/20684\"><img src=\"/play/preview/lzss-gallery/paris-street-web.png\" alt=\"Paris Street; Rainy Day by Gustave Caillebotte\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> <div class=\"rp-work-ca